[I] Set of general-purpose C programming libraries for skarnet.org software

[T] skalibs is a general-purpose low-level C library used by all the
[T] skarnet.org packages such as s6, execline and s6-rc. It provides APIs
[T] more suited to secure and efficient system programming than the libc,
[T] especially for network programming and IPC.

[U] https://skarnet.org/software/skalibs/

[A] Skalibs Authors
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

[F] CROSS
[C] extra/base

[V] 2.16.0.0
[L] ISC
